# Spellskite leaving before its ability resolves (the 2020-08-07 ruling, CR 115.7a): Bot2 Bolts Bot1, Bot1 activates
# Spellskite, and Bot2 answers with Disenchant on Spellskite. When the ability resolves, Spellskite is not on the
# battlefield to be a target, so the Bolt's target stays Bot1, who is dealt 3.

